  m_Name: NPC_35_Dialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DoctorHelp.NpcDialogueAsset
  content: "It aches deep on one side, especially after I've had something to eat.\nI tried moving my belt down, then up. Neither helped.\nMy wife says I've spent the week carrying my dinner plate back half full."
